        "text": "<p>Discover our beautiful collection of Spinal Belly Rings, crafted with Silver Charms and Steel Banana Bars for comfort, shine and lasting quality. Each design combines durable surgical steel with delicate silver detailing to create a stylish and secure piece of jewellery perfect for everyday wear.</p><p>Our Spinal Belly Bars feature elegant silver charms that move naturally with the body, creating a graceful flowing look that enhances your piercing. Choose from a range of plain and cubic zirconia designs, including clear and coloured CZ stones inspired by birthstones for a personal touch.</p><p>Every spinal belly ring in this collection is designed for secure fit, smooth wear and lasting brilliance. Whether you prefer subtle sparkle or eye-catching shine, our Silver and Steel Spinal Belly Rings offer the perfect mix of beauty, strength and comfort.</p>",
